{"overview":"باغ مظفر یک سریال تلویزیونی طنز ایرانی است که در سال ۲۰۰۶ تولید شد. این سریال توسط مهران مدیری کارگردانی شد، که همچنین به‌عنوان شخصیت اصلی روایت می‌کند و بازی می‌کند. از ۱ سپتامبر تا ۱۵ اکتبر ۲۰۰۶ پخش شد و دوباره‌پخش‌ها تا سال ۲۰۰۷ ادامه داشت.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Mozaffar's Garden is a 2006 Iranian satire television series. It was directed by Mehran Modiri, who also narrates and stars as the title character. It ran from 1 September to 15 October 2006, with reruns continuing through 2007","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":40,"y":2006,"poster":"/1ezII5SczmWoJIcO5Mrf9RVrgg0.jpg"}],"episodes":40,"crew":["مهران مدیری"],"crew_en":["Mehran Modiri"],"countries":[],"cast":[{"name":"مهران مدیری","role":"Mozaffar Zargandeh/ Narrator","photo":"/asIXC41t089MuWUSNGE07OqW9RC.jpg","en":"Mehran Modiri"},{"name":"Siamak Ansari","role":"Kamran","photo":""},{"name":"شقایق دهقان","role":"Shadi","photo":"/jwP7xKIlbrdw6imixlWTKkYOsQe.jpg","en":"Shaghayegh Dehghan"},{"name":"Sahar Jafari Jozani","role":"Forough","photo":"/e4daGN7jFMpqrDmyT7POnsRyMKh.jpg"},{"name":"رضا شفیعی‌جم","role":"Gholmorad","photo":"/nCypsB5jeMoK43T86smIxcHD0Ne.jpg","en":"Reza Shafieijam"},{"name":"Nader Soleimani","role":"","photo":"/pStB8NpbE6I8OWtXmDKlilVRF6S.jpg"},{"name":"جواد عزتی","role":"","photo":"/76owVoHT6PIyawiPl1OejExXPhK.jpg","en":"Javad Ezzati"},{"name":"Hadi Kazemi","role":"","photo":"/i8wSCyUh9vaO1opSliRJbNFqIyt.jpg"},{"name":"Nasrollah Radesh","role":"","photo":"/gNMfZnkBGl8JyjgwsVydcpM0bBI.jpg"},{"name":"الیکا عبدالرزاقی","role":"","photo":"/nYxUT1SNeECowgBlQm7vJUPsvS1.jpg","en":"Elika Abdolrazzaghi"},{"name":"Ali Lak Poorian","role":"","photo":"/vTcZqu0gKmlxCa2zk5WVHOpb4BU.jpg"},{"name":"بهنوش بختیاری","role":"","photo":"/yimO30i9hMqPX0gbgpTqiM1OFer.jpg","en":"Behnoush Bakhtiari"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/229982"}